    "name": "Python 3 program for finding maximum",
    "code": "# Python 3 program for finding maximum\n# area possible of a rectangle\n \n# function for finding max area\ndef findArea(arr, n):\n \n    s = []\n \n    # traverse through array\n    first = 0\n    second = 0\n    for i in range(n) :\n \n        # If this is first occurrence of\n        # arr[i], simply insert and continue\n        if arr[i] not in s:\n            s.append(arr[i])\n            continue\n \n        # If this is second (or more) occurrence,\n        # update first and second maximum values.\n        if (arr[i] > first) :\n            second = first\n            first = arr[i]\n        elif (arr[i] > second):\n            second = arr[i]\n \n    # return the product of dimensions\n    return (first * second)\n \n# Driver Code\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n     \n    arr = [ 4, 2, 1, 4, 6, 6, 2, 5 ]\n    n = len(arr)\n    print(findArea(arr, n))\n \n# This code is contributed by ita_c",
